{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "马鞍面与鞍点的概念探索",
    "goals": [
      "理解梯度为零不一定是局部极值点",
      "通过双截面分析马鞍面在原点不同方向的开口弯曲方向",
      "用邻域定义严谨证明原点既非局部极小也非局部极大"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "反例驱动：用梯度为零但非极值的马鞍面打破思维定势",
        "截面降维：将三维曲面沿坐标轴切开转化为一维曲线观察",
        "定义检验：用微小邻域内点的值比较进行严格否定"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 1,
        "label": "截面位置",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.005
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-02-task-01",
        "prompt": "把截面位置参数设为 1，观察截面变化情况。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "拖动滑块至右端 1。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "很好！我们清晰地看到了沿 x 方向上升与沿 y 方向下降的对比。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 1,
          "tolerance": 0.0025
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过偏导计算得到原点梯度为零，并建立马鞍面双截面观察，提出极值疑问。",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们承接上一课的计算，对函数 $f(x,y)=x^2-y^2$ 求偏导数。求得对 $x$ 的偏导为 $2x$，对 $y$ 的偏导为 $-2y$。在原点 $(0,0)$ 处，两个偏导数均为零，因此原点梯度为零。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\nabla f(0,0) = (f_x(0,0), f_y(0,0)) = (0, 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "极值质疑",
                "items": [
                  "上一课 $x^2+y^2$ 在原点梯度为零且为最低点",
                  "本课 $x^2-y^2$ 在原点梯度也为零，它也是最低点吗？"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "上一课我们看到的抛物面 $x^2+y^2$ 在原点梯度为零，且原点是全局最低点。那么对于现在的 $x^2-y^2$，原点也一定是最低点吗？我们来观察它的三维曲面图形。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "引导思考梯度为零与最低点之间的关系",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "我放置了两幅马鞍面 $z=x^2-y^2$ 的三维视图。左边一幅固定 $y=0$ 平面剖切，右边一幅固定 $x=0$ 平面剖切。请观察这两个截面与曲面交线的弯曲方向。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面 y=0",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2-y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2-y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2-y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "y",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "section.value",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-02",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "comparison_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面 x=0",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2-y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2-y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2-y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "x",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "section.value",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "right_of",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-03-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "对比观察 y=0 与 x=0 两个截面与马鞍面交线的开口方向差异",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "分析两个沿轴截面的函数剖面，并用统一参数 t 的曲线展示沿 x 方向上升与沿 y 方向下降的区别。",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们在 y 等于 0 的平面上看马鞍面，函数化简为 z 等于 x 的平方。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = 0 \\implies z = x^2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-03-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-03-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "关注 y=0 截面下的抛物线",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "在 x 等于 0 的平面上看马鞍面，函数则化简为 z 等于负 y 的平方。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x = 0 \\implies z = -y^2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-03-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "关注 x=0 截面下的开口向下抛物线",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "用统一的路径参数 t 表示，横轴为 t。上方曲线对应沿 x 方向路径，原点为最低点；下方曲线对应沿 y 方向路径，原点为最高点。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "统一路径参数 t 下的剖面曲线",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -15,
                    "max": 15,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "(x)^(2)",
                    "label": "沿 x 方向 (x,y)=(t,0)"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "curve-02",
                    "expression": "-((x)^(2))",
                    "label": "沿 y 方向 (x,y)=(0,t)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-02"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面剖面特征",
                "items": [
                  "沿 x 方向路径 (t, 0)：z = t²，原点取极小值",
                  "沿 y 方向路径 (0, t)：z = -t²，原点取极大值"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-03",
      "purpose": "运用邻域定义严谨证明马鞍面原点不是局部极小点也不是局部极大点。",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "现在我们用严谨的邻域定义来证明原点既不是局部极小点，也不是局部极大点。请看这三条核心算式。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f(t,0) = t^2 > 0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f(0,t) = -t^2 < 0 \\quad (t \\neq 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-03",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f(0,0) = 0"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-04",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "邻域判别结论",
                "items": [
                  "任意小的原点邻域内都同时存在高于0和低于0的点",
                  "原点既不是局部极小点，也不是局部极大点",
                  "截面必须保持过原点（t=0）"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-03"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦于邻域内正负函数值的对比与严谨代数逻辑",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "无论取多小的邻域，只要 t 不为 0，沿 x 轴的点都比 0 大，沿 y 轴的点都比 0 小。只要找到这样一升一降两个方向，就足以彻底否定极值。需要特别注意的是，即使两个特定方向都上升，也不足以证明全局极小；但只要存在相反方向，就能否定极值。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "强调一升一降反例法否定极值的逻辑严密性",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-04",
      "purpose": "归纳三课分析多变量函数极值的方法，并通过自查问题总结鞍点本质。",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "回顾这三节课，我们总结了分析多变量函数极值的三个核心视角：固定输出观察等高线分布、固定输入观察偏导数与截面，以及通过比较经过同一点的不同路径来判断是否为极值。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "多变量函数极值分析视角",
                "items": [
                  "固定输出：观察等高线形状与分布",
                  "固定输入：观察偏导数与沿轴截面",
                  "路径比较：对比经过同一点的不同方向曲线"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "梳理分析多变量函数极值的三个核心视角",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "将抛物面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方与马鞍面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方在原点对比：两者的梯度均为零。但抛物面在原点邻域内除原点外所有点函数值都大于零，因而形成局部极小；而马鞍面原点任意邻域内既有正值又有负值，因此它既非局部极小也非局部极大。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\text{抛物面 } z=x^2+y^2: \\nabla z(0,0)=(0,0),\\ f(x,y)\\ge 0"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\text{马鞍面 } z=x^2-y^2: \\nabla z(0,0)=(0,0),\\ f(x,y) \\text{ 异号交替}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "对比抛物面与马鞍面在原点的邻域函数值特征",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "请思考这个自查问题：如果一个函数沿 x 轴和 y 轴方向在原点都上升，就能断言原点是局部极小点吗？为什么？",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "课内自查思考",
                "items": [
                  "问题：沿 x、y 轴方向都上升，能否断言原点是局部极小点？"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "提出关于坐标轴方向与全局邻域性质关系的思考题",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "答案是不能。因为沿坐标轴方向上升仅说明沿特定两条直线方向递增，并不保证在坐标轴夹角之间的斜向路径上函数值依然大于原点值。判断局部极小必须要求在原点的整个圆盘邻域内所有点都满足 f(x,y) 大于等于 f(0,0)。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "自查解答",
                "items": [
                  "结论：不能断言。",
                  "原因：沿轴上升仅保证两个特定方向，极小点要求整个邻域内所有路径均满足 f(x,y) ≥ f(0,0)。"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "明确局部极小点必须满足全方位邻域条件的严格定义",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "本课程从偏导数为零出发，借由马鞍面的不同截面剖面展示了梯度为零并不足以保证极值存在。通过在任意小邻域内比较函数值，严谨地否定了极值性，建立了鞍点的直观与严格定义。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-03-item-02",
      "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
